SpendSigil::startOfPeriod
├── given the Minute period
│   └── it should round the timestamp down to the start of the minute
├── given the Hour period
│   └── it should round the timestamp down to the start of the hour
├── given the Day period
│   └── it should round the timestamp down to UTC midnight
├── given the Week period
│   └── it should round the timestamp down to the Thursday-aligned week boundary
├── given the Month period
│   └── it should round the timestamp down to the 1st of the month at 00:00 UTC
├── given the Year period
│   └── it should round the timestamp down to Jan 1 at 00:00 UTC
└── given the Forever period
    └── it should return 0 (the never-resets sentinel)
